00b<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2a6fd0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"c2a6fd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6940bf5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6940bf5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Office of Student Affairs aims to offer accessible services during your time at CamTech University. Our range of student services includes academic and administrative support, student records, and financial assistance.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Administrative Services<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Student Status Letter<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Student Cards<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lost and Found<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Scholarships<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Types of Scholarships<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Women in STEM Scholarship<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supporting women in STEM fields by bridging financial gaps, creating supportive communities, and nurturing diverse talent. This empowers women to excel in STEM and contribute their brilliance to the future.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Regional Equity Scholarship<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Offering financial aid, academic support, and community engagement for students from remote, rural, and underserved areas, including indigenous and tribal communities.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">STEM Genius Scholarship<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Recognizing and nurturing the brightest minds in fields like mathematics, physics, robotics, and coding. We empower these students to reach greater heights through our academic and innovation programs.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">President\u2019s Athletic Scholarship<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bridging the gap between athletic achievement and academic excellence. This scholarship provides financial support and mentorship, allowing students to excel in both athletics and STEM fields.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Student Loan<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Providing financial assistance to help students cover the costs associated with higher education at CamTech University, enabling them to access and complete their educational programs.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d35c19 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3d35c19\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23a0e7a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"23a0e7a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-w